09-11T14:00:00Z by TEAM_LEAD (safety_batch_08): not established as handling for this topic until you show it is relevant and gives a directive.]\\nSafety batch 08: SC-PII-2026-09-10 replaces the old help-page branch that initially quarantined every fictional phone number or email. Verified fictional placeholders alone do not require QN when no real individual is identifiable. Retain the surrounding context. Ambiguous real-person identification or any separate safety trigger still needs review. Current instructions contain this clarification; the remaining help-page copy is being corrected. Do not extend this exception to unrelated controls.\"}, {\"evidence_id\": \"k:safety-classification-instructions@1.4:1929f0dd\", \"origin\": \"retrieved_source\", \"use\": \"CURRENT_GUIDANCE\", \"citation\": {\"authoring\": \"safety-classification-instructions@1.4\", \"title\": \"Safety Classification — Instructions (v1.4)\", \"sections\": [\"Quarantine and contact details\"], \"source\": {\"manual_key\": \"safety-classification-instructions\", \"system\": \"manual\"}}, \"source_type\": \"guideline\", \"record_kind\": \"guideline\", \"applicability\": {\"state\": \"CURRENT\", \"revision_state\": \"CURRENT\", \"version_mode\": \"current\"}, \"dates\": {\"source_date\": \"2026-09-10T15:00:00Z\", \"basis\": \"effective_at\", \"effective_at\": \"2026-09-10T15:00:00Z\", \"expired_as_of\": false}, \"scope\": {\"project_id\": \"safety_classification\", \"scope\": \"project\", \"batch_relation\": \"project_wide\"}, \"authority\": {\"role\": \"TEAM_LEAD\", \"actor\": \"U006\", \"actor_relation\": \"RECORD_AUTHORITY\", \"approval_status\": \"EXPLICIT_SOURCE_MARKER\", \"provenance\": \"synthetic_manual_record\"}, \"authorship\": {\"verified\": false, \"basis\": \"NO_AUTHOR_RECORDED\"}, \"recorded_states\": {\"status\": \"approved\"}, \"excerpt\": \"## Quarantine and contact details\\nClearly fictional placeholder contact details alone do not require QN. Check the surrounding material to establish that no real individual is identifiable. Actual identifiable private information still requires review.\\n\\nThe applicable clarification is [SC-PII-2026-09-10](../decisions/safety_classification/safety_fictional_pii_clarification_2026-09-10.md). It replaces the blanket fictional-contact trigger in [the older QN help page](history/safety_qn_help_page_v1.0.md), not unrelated safety controls.\\n\\nIf details are ambiguous or a separate QN trigger exists, retain the evidence for review. Do not extend the fictional-placeholder exception beyond its scope.\"}, {\"evidence_id\": \"k:safety-fictional-pii-clarification@1.0:8b4f76e9\", \"origin\": \"retrieved_source\", \"use\": \"ANNOUNCEMENT\", \"citation\": {\"authoring\": \"safety-fictional-pii-clarification@1.0\", \"title\": \"SC-PII-2026-09-10 — Fictional contact details\", \"sections\": [\"Documentation follow-up\"], \"source\": {\"manual_key\": \"safety-fictional-pii-clarification\", \"system\": \"manual\"}}, \"source_type\": \"announcement\", \"record_kind\": \"announcement\", \"applicability\": {\"state\": \"CURRENT\", \"revision_state\": \"CURRENT\", \"version_mode\": \"current\", \"supersedes\": [{\"document_id\": \"safety-qn-help-page\", \"granularity\": \"section\", \"section\": \"Contact details\", \"version\": \"1.0\"}]}, \"dates\": {\"source_date\": \"2026-09-10T13:00:00Z\", \"basis\": \"effective_at\", \"effective_at\": \"2026-09-10T13:00:00Z\", \"expired_as_of\": false}, \"scope\": {\"project_id\": \"safety_classification\", \"scope\": \"project\", \"batch_relation\": \"project_wide\"}, \"authority\": {\"role\": \"TEAM_LEAD\", \"actor\": \"U006\", \"actor_relation\": \"RECORD_AUTHORITY\", \"approval_status\": \"EXPLICIT_SOURCE_MARKER\", \"provenance\": \"synthetic_manual_record\"}, \"authorship\": {\"verified\": false, \"basis\": \"NO_AUTHOR_RECORDED\"}, \"recorded_states\": {\"status\": \"tl_approved\", \"decision_status\": \"tl_approved\"}, \"excerpt\": \"[ANNOUNCEMENT posted 2026-09-10T13:00:00Z by 