 within the relevant project, batch, and time window, suggesting broader disruption or systemic labeling risk. Consider the number affected relative to the known active group when that information is available; do not require an explicit statement of widespread impact\"}]}, \"MEDIUM\": {\"definition\": \"Issue that may affect labeling accuracy, QA consistency, or operational efficiency, requiring clarification or intervention. Impact appears meaningful but contained or manageable based on the available context. A question alone does not establish MEDIUM, but its content may reveal consequential uncertainty.\", \"examples\": \"Recurring rubric ambiguity; conflicting QA interpretations; intermittent LT failures affecting task completion; unclear QN handling for a specific edge case. Examples include similar pairs receiving inconsistent tie judgments, reviewers disagreeing over clipping severity, or playback repeatedly failing and then recovering.\", \"signals\": [{\"index\": 0, \"text\": \"Recurring confusion about the same rule, tool behavior, or scoring criterion that suggests meaningful workflow or labeling impact\"}, {\"index\": 1, \"text\": \"Conflicting interpretations that affect, or are reasonably likely to affect, how tasks are scored or handled\"}, {\"index\": 2, \"text\": \"Intermittent or contained tool/process failure suggesting a meaningful interruption, with context indicating that work remains possible or access recovers\"}]}, \"LOW\": {\"definition\": \"Localized issue that appears to have limited impact on labeling quality or workflow. The available context suggests a minor inconvenience or straightforward correction rather than a substantive operational problem.\", \"examples\": \"One-off clarification of otherwise clear guidance; minor LT inconvenience; isolated inconsistency with little downstream impact; a confusing FAQ heading when the underlying rule is understood and usable.\", \"signals\": []}, \"N/A\": {\"definition\": \"No identifiable operational problem or risk requiring severity assessment. Includes casual chat, pure social threads, and routine announcements.\", \"examples\": \"Routine announcements, informational updates, acknowledgments, administrative messages, general discussion without an actionable issue.\", \"signals\": []}, \"UNKNOWN\": {\"definition\": \"The report and available context are too ambiguous or incomplete to meaningfully assess operational impact. Missing explicit impact wording, affected-task counts, or a confirmed technical cause does not by itself require UNKNOWN.\", \"examples\": \"'Something looks wrong' without describing the behavior; a report referring to missing context; contradictory accounts that leave it unclear whether there is a minor display issue or an inability to complete the task.\", \"signals\": []}}}, \"limits\": {\"follow_up_queries\": 3}, \"previous_draft\": {\"contract_version\": \"agent3-advisor-draft-v11\", \"summary\": \"A tutor reports that a pinned QN post contradicts the updated handbook and asks whether a later announcement replaces the older note. The team lead requested the exact conflicting branches; the supplied thread does not contain those details or a ruling on which source applies.\", \"summary_sentences\": [{\"text\": \"A tutor reports that a pinned QN post contradicts the updated handbook and asks whether a later announcement replaces the older note.\", \"support_claim_ids\": [\"c1\"], \"depends_on\": []}, {\"text\": \"The team lead requested the exact conflicting branches; the supplied thread does not contain those details or a ruling on which source applies.\", \"support_claim_ids\": [\"c3\", \"c4\"], \"depends_on\": []}], \"detail_sentences\": [{\"text\": \"The tutor references SAFETY-2292, while a QA tutor asks which document was updated most recently and by whom.\", \"support_claim_ids\": [\"c1\", \"c2\"], \"depends_on\": [], \"summary_depends_on\": []}, {\"text\": \"The current FAQ requires checking source identity, scope, authori